  partName: Oil Sump Gasket
  description: The oil sump gasket is a small, thin-flat component located at the
    center of the engine, responsible for sealing the oil sump and preventing leaks.
    Its metal-dark material and extremely high vertex count suggest a focus on durability
    and sealing performance. The oil sump gasket is a critical component of the engine,
    requiring precise design and engineering to achieve reliable operation and prevent
    oil leaks.
